==Battleground==
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~46.67 seconds<sup>700f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuya]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

